<title>JAPAN: Matsuo Bridge - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Matsuo Bridge - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.81		vs	   15.34</p>
<p> Operating	  364    million	  vs	  261    million</p>
<p> Current	    395    million	  vs	  398    million</p>
<p> Net		  199    million	  vs	  251    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.02 yen	  vs	    9.10 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     28 million	  vs	  28 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsuo Bridge Co Ltd makes steel frames and builds bridges.</p>
</text>
